⟦ range_push: push integers [Ψ top .. Ω top] onto Ω  ( end -- n0..nN | start -- ) ⟧
⦿ range_push [ ℤ → ℤ | ℤ → ]
  ⋯
⌸0xCB392225
⦾

⟦ sum_range: sum of integers from Ψ top to Ω top  ( end -- sum | start -- ) ⟧
⦿ sum_range [ ℤ → ℤ | ℤ → ]
  ⋯ ∑
⌸0xF1559E7D
⦾

⟦ prod_range: product of integers from Ψ top to Ω top ⟧
